# {{lb|en|Irish|British|slang}} {{non-gloss|Used for emphasis at the beginning of a sentence when expressing an opinion or want.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Here,''' I'm tired and I want a drink.}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} {{non-gloss|Used to attract someone's attention, often in a hostile way.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Here'''! You! Stop doing that!}}
# {{n-g|Said in response to one's name being called during a [[roll call]], indicating that one is present.}}
#: {{ux|en|Smith ... '''Here'''! ... Jones ... '''Here'''! ... Walters ... ... Anyone seen Walters?}}
# {{n-g|Said to command a person or higher animal to come to the speaker.}}
#: {{ux|en|"Fido! '''Here'''!" — "Woof! Woof!"}}

